{"page":269,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:15","surah":16,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَلْقَىٰ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ رَوَٰسِىَ أَن تَمِيدَ بِكُمْ وَأَنْهَـٰرًا وَسُبُلًا لَّعَلَّكُمْ تَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He has made mountains stand firm on the earth, to prevent it shaking under you, and rivers and paths so that you may find your way,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَلْقَىٰ","en_gloss":"And He has cast","transliteration":"wa-alqā","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَوَٰسِىَ","en_gloss":"firm mountains","transliteration":"rawāsiya","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"lest","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَمِيدَ","en_gloss":"it should shake","transliteration":"tamīda","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِكُمْ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"bikum","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنْهَـٰرًۭا","en_gloss":"and rivers","transliteration":"wa-anhāran","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَسُبُلًۭا","en_gloss":"and roads","transliteration":"wasubulan","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَهْتَدُونَ","en_gloss":"be guided","transliteration":"tahtadūna","verse_key":"16:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:15"}]},{"verse_key":"16:16","surah":16,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"وَعَلَـٰمَـٰتٍ ۚ وَبِٱلنَّجْمِ هُمْ يَهْتَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and landmarks and stars to guide people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَعَلَـٰمَـٰتٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"And landmarks","transliteration":"waʿalāmātin","verse_key":"16:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَبِٱلنَّجْمِ","en_gloss":"And by the stars","transliteration":"wabil-najmi","verse_key":"16:16"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_