:"دُونِ","en_gloss":"besides","transliteration":"dūni","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَخْلُقُونَ","en_gloss":"they create","transliteration":"yakhluqūna","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"but (are) themselves","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُخْلَقُونَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"yukh'laqūna","verse_key":"16:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:20"}]},{"verse_key":"16:21","surah":16,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰتٌ غَيْرُ أَحْيَآءٍ ۖ وَمَا يَشْعُرُونَ أَيَّانَ يُبْعَثُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They are dead, not living. They do not know when they will be raised up.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْوَٰتٌ","en_gloss":"(They are) dead","transliteration":"amwātun","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"غَيْرُ","en_gloss":"not alive","transliteration":"ghayru","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَحْيَآءٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"not alive","transliteration":"aḥyāin","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَشْعُرُونَ","en_gloss":"they perceive","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَيَّانَ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"ayyāna","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُبْعَثُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be resurrected","transliteration":"yub'ʿathūna","verse_key":"16:21"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢١","en_gloss":"(21)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:21"}]},{"verse_key":"16:22","surah":16,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهُكُمْ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ ۚ فَٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ قُلُوبُهُم مُّنكِرَةٌ وَهُم مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your God is the One God. As for those who deny the life to come, their hearts refuse to admit the truth and they are arrogant.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَـٰهُكُمْ","en_gloss":"Your god","transliteration":"ilāhukum","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"One","transliteration":"wāḥidun","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"fa-alladhīna","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُم","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُّنكِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"refuse","transliteration":"munkiratun","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) arrogant","transliteration":"mus'takbirūna","verse_key":"16:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:22"}]},{"verse_key":"16:23","surah":16,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"لَا جَرَمَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعْلِنُونَ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُسْتَكْبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There is no doubt that God knows what they conceal and what they reveal. He does not love the arrogant.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No doubt","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَرَمَ","en_gloss":"No doubt","transliteration":"jarama","verse_key":"16:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"16:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"16:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_glos