,"en_gloss":"(of) the ancient","transliteration":"l-awalīna","verse_key":"16:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:24"}]},{"verse_key":"16:25","surah":16,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"لِيَحْمِلُوٓا۟ أَوْزَارَهُمْ كَامِلَةً يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۙ وَمِنْ أَوْزَارِ ٱلَّذِينَ يُضِلُّونَهُم بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍ ۗ أَلَا سَآءَ مَا يَزِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On the Day of Resurrection they will bear the full weight of their own burden, as well as some of the burden of those they misled with no true knowledge. How terrible their burden will be!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِيَحْمِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"That they may bear","transliteration":"liyaḥmilū","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْزَارَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their own burdens","transliteration":"awzārahum","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَامِلَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(in) full","transliteration":"kāmilatan","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"on (the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۙ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"and of","transliteration":"wamin","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْزَارِ","en_gloss":"the burdens","transliteration":"awzāri","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُضِلُّونَهُم","en_gloss":"they misled [them]","transliteration":"yuḍillūnahum","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِلْمٍ ۗ","en_gloss":"knowledge","transliteration":"ʿil'min","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلَا","en_gloss":"Unquestionably","transliteration":"alā","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَآءَ","en_gloss":"evil","transliteration":"sāa","verse_key":"16:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(is) what","transliteration":"mā","vers